            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582783,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Franz Schubert's Childhood and Education</strong><br>\nFranz Schubert was born in Vienna, Austria, in 1797, and showed musical promise from a young age. He was the son of a schoolmaster, which allowed him a good basic education. Schubert received formal musical training from his family and later attended the Stadtkonvikt, which served as a training ground for the Vienna Boys' Choir. His talents were recognized early, and he received lessons from Antonio Salieri, who also taught Beethoven.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Early Compositions</strong><br>\nDespite his short life, Schubert was a prolific composer, beginning his work while still a teenager. He composed songs, piano pieces, and chamber music as a student, demonstrating a natural mastery of form and harmony. His music from this period already showed the melodic beauty and depth of emotion that would characterize his mature work.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Struggle for Recognition</strong><br>\nSchubert spent the majority of his life in Vienna, but he struggled to gain widespread recognition during his lifetime. He worked as a school teacher for some time to make ends meet, all the while composing at a prodigious rate. His work included a variety of genres, but it was his lieder, or art songs, for which he was most revered by his contemporaries.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "53bc5361-5ce5-43a9-a00f-57bbceee9cd0"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
